# One line ending in the repository, whatever anybody's editor does locally.
#
# Without this, every commit from this machine warns that LF will become CRLF,
# and a contributor on another platform eventually commits a file with the
# other ending -- which shows up as a diff touching every line of a file nobody
# meaningfully changed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts that Windows tooling is happier reading with CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Not text. Normalising these corrupts them.
*.png binary
*.jar binary
*.cube binary
*.ico binary
